      "content": "look im just trying to figure out what to do tonight... it's getting really red and the skin is stretched tight. if i can't see a doctor, what else can i do to help it drain? can i use a warm compress or anything to at least try to bring it to a head so it pops naturally? i'm just trying to avoid it getting way worse while i try to save up for a clinic visit.",
